  "steps": [
    "Trim the garlic cloves, crush them using a garlic press, and mince finely with a knife.",
    "Add a palmful of coarse salt to a pot of water to boil pasta.",
    "Pour olive oil into a heated frying pan, add the minced garlic, and fry until fragrant and lightly golden.",
    "Ladle pasta cooking water into the pan with the cooked garlic.",
    "Add the cooked spaghetti into the pan and stir.",
    "Drizzle in additional olive oil and continuously toss and stir the pasta vigorously to emulsify the sauce (mantecatura).",
    "Twirl the pasta and plate neatly, spooning the remaining emulsified garlic oil sauce over top."
  ],
